{"title":"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems\">2004 AMC 12A #1</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">2004 AMC 10A #3</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Alternate_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Alicia earns 20 dollars per hour, of which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/3/243a46ef9e8657511d73a47d331a8cc32fcf182a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.45\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> is deducted to pay local taxes.  How many cents per hour of Alicia's wages are used to pay local taxes?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/2/80279bee3f7c8dd2f4f602443c5739e744f837f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 0.0029 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 0.029 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 0.29 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 2.9 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 29$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"462\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> dollars is the same as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/f/05f1ffc8a6829f25b0b0366087a70dfd4e06fef6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> cents, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/3/243a46ef9e8657511d73a47d331a8cc32fcf182a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.45\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/f/05f1ffc8a6829f25b0b0366087a70dfd4e06fef6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/e/a0eafc9a8b1f39fb7a56fed899f830bea9a47ef7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.0145\\times2000=29$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"153\" height=\"15\" /> cents. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/7/1170eac0003d7d478b25d0e30c884019ad93e893.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 29}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"85\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_Solution\">Alternate Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Alternate Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p>Since there can't be decimal values of cents, the answer must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/7/1170eac0003d7d478b25d0e30c884019ad93e893.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 29}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"85\" height=\"29\" />. \n</p><p>~MathKatana\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/06TIuTrUHls\">https://youtu.be/06TIuTrUHls</a>\n</p><p>Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align